// Kill-switch service worker (see sw.js — same code, both URLs needed:
// Chirpy v6+ registered its PWA worker as /sw.min.js, older versions as
// /sw.js). Wipes all caches, unregisters itself, and reloads open tabs.
//
// This file must stay deployed at the site root indefinitely (a 404 here does
// NOT remove the old worker — only a successfully installed replacement does).
self.addEventListener('install', () => {
  self.skipWaiting();
});

self.addEventListener('activate', (event) => {
  event.waitUntil(
    (async () => {
      const keys = await caches.keys();
      await Promise.all(keys.map((key) => caches.delete(key)));
      await self.registration.unregister();
      const clients = await self.clients.matchAll({ type: 'window' });
      clients.forEach((client) => client.navigate(client.url));
    })()
  );
});
